  1257                              <1> ; no closer; anything else that runs into the NUL had unbalanced brackets
  1258                              <1> ; anyway). ECX counts the open levels, from 1 for the one we are in.
  1259                              <1> ;
  1260                              <1> ; The checked build also looks at the character the skip was started by,
  1261                              <1> ; which is always the one just before where it starts: '(' must end at ')',
