  1345                              <1> 
  1346                              <1> ; hexc: if the character at IP is a hex digit (0-9, A-F, a-f), step over it
  1347                              <1> ; and return its value in AL with the carry set; otherwise leave the IP and
  1348                              <1> ; return with the carry clear.
